  "question": {
    "text": "An aeroplane is flying at a velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>900</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> loops a vertical circular loop. If the maximum force pressing the pilot against the seat is five times his weight, what would be the diameter (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>) of the loop? [ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> ]"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3125",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>900</mo><msup><mtext>km&nbsp;h</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>900</mtext> <mo>×</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>18</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mtext>250&nbsp;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0015_055c6bef5391.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 156px; height: 140px;\" /><br /><br />the maximum force is at the bottom of the vertical circle<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>max</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext>4</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">gr</mtext></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mtext>4</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">g</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mtext>250</mtext></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mtext>10</mtext></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mtext>1562.5&nbsp;</mtext><mo>m</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3125</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>"
